    {
      "question": "main.py如何启动、运行主循环、切换战斗和退出？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "Start/StartStep1初始化；Loop默认MainLoop；WarLoop调用MainLoop并处理战斗；SetWarLoop/SetMainLoop切换；CloseGame/ExitGame/RealExit/doexit/doreturn处理退出与重登录。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "start",
          "mainloop",
          "warloop",
          "exit",
          "doreturn"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "公告失败在哪触发，正文/地址/布局分别改哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "公告逻辑在entry 337 mainpage.py：refreshbulletin失败弹窗；正文news.txt，地址update.ini，布局login/mainpage.dlg。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "mainloop"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "登录按钮点击后经过哪些函数和模块？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "登录入口在loginin.OnMessage(2)->LoginOk；连接由netserver/netlogin处理；E协审。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "mainloop"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "注册逻辑与布局分别在哪里？",
